// A function inside another calls a generic function over a value built
// from the outer parameter: the call's cell was fixed at bottom in the
// definition and each instance read `Array<_>` (soak nov24e, the check
// accepted what the build refused).
// Expected trace (both engines): (1, 1).
{ let f = |x| { let x = [1, x, 3]; let f = |y: i64| array::len(x); let r = f(0); r - 2 }; (f(3), f("s")) }
